# Every PR needs a review from the owner of the code it touches.
# GitHub auto-requests these reviewers. Replace the placeholders with real
# GitHub usernames before enabling "Require review from Code Owners".
#
# Later entries win, so put the specific paths last.

*                       @ORG/restaurant-team

/backend/               @backend-owner-username
/mobile/                @mobile-owner-username
/docs/                  @ORG/restaurant-team

# Anything that changes how the repo is built or protected needs the
